\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stationary}\">\\(\\mathrm{Stationary}\\)</span> (stationarity predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{bad}\">\\(\\mathrm{bad}\\)</span> (badness predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}badness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{bad}(\\kappa,\\lambda)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists f\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\kappa,\\lambda)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\n\\neg\\mathrm{Stationary}(f^{-1}[\\{\\alpha\\}],\\kappa)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}badness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{bad}(\\kappa,\\lambda)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists f\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\kappa,\\lambda)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\n\\neg\\mathrm{Stationary}(f^{-1}[\\{\\alpha\\}],\\kappa)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Badness is witnessed by a colouring of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> into <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> whose every colour class is nonstationary.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Stationary}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{bad}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}badness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{bad}(\\kappa,\\lambda)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\exists f\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\kappa,\\lambda)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\n\\neg\\mathrm{Stationary}(f^{-1}[\\{\\alpha\\}],\\kappa)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false}],"bytes":1218,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3875","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-lem-badness.md|58-lem-badness]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["5fb1c2241d1943d1","0fbfc19800246e77","36d7463d215be7